# Large regenerable routing graph (rebuild via scripts/build_graph.py).
# The versioned artifact (v1.pkl + its manifest) IS committed -- it's the
# packaged graph the app loads at runtime, see docs/graph-packaging.md.
# The legacy unversioned .gpickle/.graphml stay ignored.
backend/data/manhattan_walk_graph.*
!backend/data/manhattan_walk_graph.v1.pkl
!backend/data/manhattan_walk_graph.v1.manifest.json

